  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: @ppa-web-components/ppa-hotel-collection (npm)",
  "details": "This package is a dependency-confusion proof of concept. Its postinstall hook runs beacon.cjs, which sends a single HTTP POST of JSON host metadata — package name, hostname, install path, working directory and Node version — to hxxp://185[.]158[.]107[.]175:8787/_ah/dc with an X-Beacon-Package header. index.js re-fires the same beacon when the module is imported and exports a no-op Proxy so importing code does not crash. No credentials, tokens, environment values or file contents are read or transmitted.",
